// WARNING: one due day nothing kept. The manager's fee of January was never written, and the contract ends with the month: the
// warning says the one day and how to write it down, and has no `until` to offer, the contract has one.
base USD
use std

entity hartwell
account checking : bank

opening 2026-01-01
  checking 10_000 USD

contract manager-fee with hartwell
  200 USD monthly on 5 from checking
  from 2026-01-05
  until 2026-01-31
